OWLv2 frozen-vocabulary Core ML adapter
========================================

Host preprocessing
------------------

Source repository:
  https://github.com/huggingface/transformers

Pinned source:
  v5.12.1
  source commit ddb849abe009d1089e6c691bfc897f27211c663c
  annotated tag object a030302dcd4777bbf042ee46c30c5dbe6d2a2eb2

Relevant upstream file:
  src/transformers/models/owlv2/image_processing_owlv2.py

License:
  Apache License 2.0

LibreYOLO use:
  libreyolo/export/coreml_owlv2.py adapts the OWLv2 rescale, bottom/right
  square-pad, Gaussian antialias, and bilinear-resize order into a small
  host preprocessing function. The exported graph uses LibreYOLO's existing
  native OWLv2 implementation in libreyolo/models/owlv2/nn.py and freezes a
  finite set of text embeddings. No tokenizer or text tower remains in the
  deployment graph.

